{
  "id": "indexed-catalog",
  "class": "D",
  "objective": "Repair Catalog insert, rename and remove so the ID-to-name map and name-to-ID map always agree. Names are exact strings (including empty and Unicode); do not normalize them. Insert rejects existing IDs first (DuplicateId), then names owned by another ID (DuplicateName). Rename rejects unknown IDs first (UnknownId), then names owned by another ID (DuplicateName); renaming to the current name succeeds unchanged. Remove rejects unknown IDs (UnknownId) and removes both indexes on success. Every error preserves both indexes. Preserve all public APIs, getters, snapshot ordering and unrelated methods. All three implementation files need repair.",
